    <title>
        fix(fireworks-ai): remove retired models (#8135)
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-26T16:21:18Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107808273?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>shzdehmd</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/shzdehmd</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;fix(fireworks-ai): remove retired models (#8135)

Fireworks AI retired:
- deepseek-v4-pro and minimax-m2p7 on 2026-08-27
- qwen3p7-plus on 2026-09-04
- all other removed models on 2026-09-25 at 7PM PST:
  glm-5p2, glm-5p2-fast, kimi-k2p6, kimi-k2p7-code,
  deepseek-v4-flash-0731, deepseek-v4-pro-0813,
  deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp, muse-glimmer-30b.

  deepseek-v4-pro-0813 is a separate, newer snapshot that had replaced
  deepseek-v4-pro on 08/27.
  deepseek-flash-latest is unaffected (targets deepseek-v4p1-flash).&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
